Whenever I tell you "test this" what I mean is that you should write a test under the "tests" directory. I tend to group tests by module prepending them by a 

test_0_
test_1_
test_2_

that number is a subjective guide to measure the level of abstraction of the test, meaning, that test_0_ are tests meant to have no other dependencies with methods etc and be hermetic, while test_2_ are meant to test elements that depend on many other things. This is subjective and not hardcore enforced
